# Keep the Vercel upload small: only what the two services build or serve.
# The `site` service needs web/ (+ its lockfile) and deploy/; the `api` service
# needs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/ and .cargo/. Anything else is docs, tests
# or build output and only slows the upload down.

.git
.github
.githooks
docs
tests
scripts
book
book.toml
target
node_modules
web/node_modules
web/dist
render.yaml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
